"""RT9013-33GB - RICHTEK 500 mA fixed 3.3 V LDO (SOT-23-5) reference design.

High-PSRR, low-noise CMOS LDO with a fixed 3.3 V output. Stable with
low-ESR ceramic capacitors and needs no output bypass capacitor
(Richtek RT9013 datasheet, DS9013-10).

Operating envelope (datasheet "Recommended Operating Conditions"):
- VIN: 2.2 V to 5.5 V
- VOUT: 3.3 V fixed, up to 500 mA
- Dropout 250 mV typ at 500 mA; quiescent 25 uA typ, 0.7 uA in shutdown

Support circuitry (datasheet "Application Information"):
- C_in: >= 1 uF X7R ceramic at VIN, placed < 0.5 in from the VIN pin.
- C_out: >= 1 uF ceramic (ESR > 5 mOhm) at VOUT, placed < 0.5 in from the
  VOUT pin; sets loop stability.

EN is active-high CMOS and must NOT be left floating (datasheet "Enable").
A strap resistor biases EN so it is never floating: `en_strap` selects a
pull-up to VIN (default, always-on) or a pull-down to GND (default-off);
the unused strap is left unpopulated. EN is also exposed so the integrator
can drive it from a logic output.
"""

Capacitor = Module("@stdlib/generics/Capacitor.zen")
Resistor = Module("@stdlib/generics/Resistor.zen")

en_strap = config(str, default="PULLUP", allowed=["PULLUP", "PULLDOWN"])

VIN = io(Power(voltage="2.2V to 5.5V"))
GND = io(Ground)
EN = io(Net, optional=True)
VOUT = io(Power(voltage="3.3V"))

Component(
    name="U1",
    symbol=Symbol(library="RT9013-33GB.kicad_sym"),
    pins={"VIN": VIN, "GND": GND, "EN": EN, "VOUT": VOUT},
)

Capacitor(name="C_in", value="1uF", voltage="10V", package="0402", P1=VIN, P2=GND)
Capacitor(name="C_out", value="1uF", voltage="10V", package="0402", P1=VOUT, P2=GND)

# EN bias straps: populate one per `en_strap`; EN must never float (datasheet).
Resistor(name="R_EN_PU", value="100kohm", package="0402", P1=EN, P2=VIN, dnp=en_strap != "PULLUP")
Resistor(name="R_EN_PD", value="100kohm", package="0402", P1=EN, P2=GND, dnp=en_strap != "PULLDOWN")

Layout(name="RT9013-33GB", path="layout/RT9013-33GB")

